[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14041.99, "timestamp": "03:54:01", "text": "人问。所以我就想，我不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14044.389, "timestamp": "03:54:04", "text": "要知道，如果你进入人生，它总是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14046.63, "timestamp": "03:54:06", "text": "两个都。你只需要平衡一下。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14049.51, "timestamp": "03:54:09", "text": "看看哪一款当天表现更好。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 14050.667, "timestamp": "03:54:10", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "🤧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14052.15, "timestamp": "03:54:12", "text": "你顺其自然。你知道我的意思？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14054.63, "timestamp": "03:54:14", "text": "它并不总是对的或错的。这一切都是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14056.55, "timestamp": "03:54:16", "text": "两者兼有。你只需要在……等候。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14058.389, "timestamp": "03:54:18", "text": "对，还有长线，然后你就走"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14061.99, "timestamp": "03:54:21", "text": "它。这就是生活。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14064.59, "timestamp": "03:54:24", "text": "但你更看重事实而非人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14067.99, "timestamp": "03:54:27", "text": "情怀。不，我通常会优先考虑"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14070.79, "timestamp": "03:54:30", "text": "他人的感受。就像你知道的那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14074.55, "timestamp": "03:54:34", "text": "正如我所说，我通常会让那个人……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14077.11, "timestamp": "03:54:37", "text": "先休息一天，而不是直接停工。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14079.269, "timestamp": "03:54:39", "text": "第一天你就明白我的意思了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14081.67, "timestamp": "03:54:41", "text": "所以，是的，那就是你经常会遇到的情况。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14085.99, "timestamp": "03:54:45", "text": "总是允许你经常允许一天的时间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14092.55, "timestamp": "03:54:52", "text": "这就是我的风格"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14093.83, "timestamp": "03:54:53", "text": "我不在乎，我不在乎，我不在乎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14095.309, "timestamp": "03:54:55", "text": "我不做那些安排。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14097.91, "timestamp": "03:54:57", "text": "计划就是这样，事情就这么发生了，我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14099.75, "timestamp": "03:54:59", "text": "顺其自然，你很少会担心"}]